    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Все, я готов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, I am ready.' Having packed up the leftover food, Kostya announces that he is ready.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Пойдем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go.' He tells Nastya and the others that it is time to head out.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Все, давайте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, see you.' Staying behind in the kitchen, Max waves them off.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Привет бомжам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Say hi to the bums.' Max jokes crudely by telling Kostya to say hello to the street bums.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Не бомжам, а бездомным.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not bums, but homeless.' Kostya immediately corrects him, insisting on the respectful word 'homeless'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Смотрите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look.' Max tells them to watch themselves out there.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Заразу не принесите в дом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not bring infection home.' He teases his roommate not to bring any germs back to their apartment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "От кого?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From whom?' Kostya asks who Max thinks they would catch something from.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "От бездомных.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From the homeless.' Max replies bluntly that he means the homeless people they are helping.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Мы будем осторожны.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will be careful.' Kostya assures him that they will be careful.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Надеюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hope.' Max says he certainly hopes so.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "До вечера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Until evening.' Kostya says goodbye until the evening.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
